1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,959
We promised to protect fertile soil and fertilise carefully.

2
00:00:03,909 --> 00:00:08,738
Beside an artificial pond, we would remove synthetic waste and plant trees.

3
00:00:08,738 --> 00:00:13,931
One day, children could rest in their shade and watch each shadow move across the path.

4
00:00:13,931 --> 00:00:18,113
Damage was not inevitable, although some harm could be irreversible.

5
00:00:18,113 --> 00:00:21,261
We closed the letter and opened our notebooks again.

6
00:00:21,261 --> 00:00:26,147
This time, we covered the English words and tried to tell the whole story from memory.

7
00:00:26,147 --> 00:00:29,727
The words we could not remember would be tomorrow’s first review.

